 581:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h **** /** \defgroup IfxLld_Cpu_Intrinsics_Gnucmiscellaneous Miscellaneous Intrinsic Functions
