1483:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** /** \brief API to get current Ramp sequence status.
1484:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
